WEBVTT

00:00:58.612 --> 00:01:00.822
but to bring it to anyone

00:01:00.822 --> 00:01:02.452
in the world for free.

00:01:02.452 --> 00:01:05.020
We announced the class on July 29th,

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:08.229
and within two weeks, 50,000 people

00:01:08.229 --> 00:01:09.636
had signed up for it.

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:12.741
And that grew to 160,000 students

00:01:12.741 --> 00:01:14.805
from 209 countries.

00:01:14.805 --> 00:01:16.613
We were thrilled to have

00:01:16.613 --> 00:01:17.734
that kind of audience,

00:01:17.734 --> 00:01:20.373
and just a bit terrified that we

00:01:20.373 --> 00:01:22.684
hadn't finished preparing the class yet. (Laughter)

00:01:22.684 --> 00:01:24.296
So we got to work.

00:01:24.296 --> 00:01:25.932
We studied what others had done,

00:01:25.932 --> 00:01:28.255
what we could copy and what we could change.

00:01:28.255 --> 00:01:30.916
Benjamin Bloom had showed